{
  "about": "Cases both hygiene scanners must agree on (scripts/platform/test/hygiene-scan.test.mjs and python/tests/platform/test_gates_hygiene.py). The names below are made up: each test adds their sha256 to a copy of the real rules. A text that would fail the scan of this file is written with a JSON escape (\\u0056 is V), so this file passes the scan it feeds.",
